    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454170/extras/a4bb66d489798d20650ebe4030932836.poster.avif?t=1691430463\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454170/extras/a4bb66d489798d20650ebe4030932836.webm?t=1691430463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454170/extras/a4bb66d489798d20650ebe4030932836.mp4?t=1691430463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Draw your own characters</strong> in Doodle Dice Monsters, a <strong>fast and strategic turn-based fighter</strong>! Form your six character dream team, then fight in tag-team combat in either multi-player or single-player mode: the winner not only gets epic loot, but gets to<strong> take one of the defeated Doodlemon</strong> for their own! Crush <strong>friends and foes</strong> alike as you level up and gain epic customization options, like backgrounds, palettes, and more!<br><br>Using the <strong>draw feature</strong>, your team can compose of whomever or whatever you want!<br>A monster's tier is determined by how long you spend drawing it. You start out with just the default palette, but unlock more as you play the game!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454170/extras/46832af59950c88b502d2df74158d082.poster.avif?t=1691430463\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454170/extras/46832af59950c88b502d2df74158d082.webm?t=1691430463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454170/extras/46832af59950c88b502d2df74158d082.mp4?t=1691430463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Tagteam</strong> wisely to take advantage of type vulnerabilities and each monster tier's <strong>unique moveset</strong>! Succesfully predicting your opponent's moves and creating favorable matchups will help ensure you leave the battlefield with an extra monster in your collection and epic loot in your inventory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454170/extras/9a371c4360b8991b05a2f7139b09e164.poster.avif?t=1691430463\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454170/extras/9a371c4360b8991b05a2f7139b09e164.webm?t=1691430463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454170/extras/9a371c4360b8991b05a2f7139b09e164.mp4?t=1691430463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Draw your own monsters, giving you full cosmetic control<br></li><li> Fast, turn-based combat<br></li><li> Highly strategic gameplay with a moderate amount of RNG<br></li><li> Low barrier to entry<br></li><li> Stakes overarch individual matches<br></li><li> Unlock backgrounds to show off, palettes to draw with, food to feed your monsters, and more!<br></li><li> High replayability<br></li><li> 6 Tiers with unique movesets and 7 types with type vulnerabilities<br></li><li> Limited use abilities that require thoughtful use</li></ul><br>",
